[
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "中华人民共和国国家标准",
        "page_idx": 0,
        "text_level": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "技术制 图比例",
        "text_level": 1,
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "代替GB4457.2—84 ",
        "page_idx": 0,
        "text_level": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Technical drawings Scales ",
        "text_level": 0,
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "本标准等效采用国际标准ISO5455—1979《技术制图——比例》。",
        "page_idx": 0,
        "text_level": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1主题内容与适用范围",
        "text_level": 1,
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "本标准规定了绘图比例及其标注方法。  \n本标准适用于技术图样及有关技术文件。",
        "page_idx": 0,
        "text_level": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2引用标准",
        "text_level": 1,
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "GB/T 13361 技术制图 通用术语",
        "page_idx": 0,
        "text_level": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3术语",
        "text_level": 1,
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3. 1 比例 scale ",
        "text_level": 2,
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "图中图形与其实物相应要素的线性尺寸之比。",
        "page_idx": 0,
        "text_level": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3.2 原值比例 full size ",
        "text_level": 2,
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "比值为1的比例，即1：1。",
        "page_idx": 0,
        "text_level": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3.3放大比例 enlargement scale",
        "text_level": 2,
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "比值大于1的比例，如2：1等。",
        "page_idx": 0,
        "text_level": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3.4缩小比例reduction scale ",
        "text_level": 2,
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "比值小于1的比例，如1：2等。",
        "page_idx": 0,
        "text_level": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "4 比例系列",
        "text_level": 1,
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "4.1需要按比例绘制图样时，应由表1规定的系列中选取适当的比例。",
        "text_level": 2,
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "table",
        "img_path": "/home/crrc/PycharmProjects/FlaskOllama/data/parse_files_data/8b204c36-4716-450f-a50b-8b1a63b0ee34/f6bce4ccddb8688eeb4f04d6ab374d8aadb7995a99949620b0ac87d213b7fce4.jpg",
        "table_caption": [
            "表1"
        ],
        "table_footnote": [
            "国家技术监督局1993-11-09批准"
        ],
        "page_idx": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "注：为正整数。",
        "page_idx": 0,
        "text_level": 0
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "4.2必要时，也允许选取表2中的比例。",
        "page_idx": 0,
        "text_level": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1994-07-01实施 ",
        "page_idx": 0,
        "text_level": 0
    },
